  "Combat.Ability.Tease.Name": "Tease"
  "Combat.Ability.TentacleAttack.Description": "The beast throws its tentacles at you with murderous force."
  "Combat.Ability.TentacleAttack.Name": "Tentacle Attack"
  "Combat.Ability.TentacleEntwine.Description": "Tentacles lunge at you from all directions, trying to immobilize you."
  "Combat.Ability.TentacleEntwine.Name": "Entwine"
  "Combat.Ability.TrainingDummyDummyWait.Description": "The dummy does nothing."
