  "Combat.Ability.ValaMasturbate.Description": "Vala puts on a brazen show, fingering herself."
  "Combat.Ability.ValaMasturbate.Name": "Lewd Show"
  "Combat.Ability.ValaMasturbate.Text": "The mind-fucked faerie spreads her thighs and dips a finger into her slit, putting on quite the show before asking, [say: Did you like that? Will you fuck Vala now?]"
  "Combat.Ability.ValaSpecial1.Description": "Vala licks her own blood and blows out a cloud of pink mist."
  "Combat.Ability.ValaSpecial1.Heavy": "Vala blows out a thick, cloying cloud of pink that fills the room with bubblegum sweetness. Even the shallowest breath makes your crotch thrum with excitement."
  "Combat.Ability.ValaSpecial1.Light": "Vala dabs at one of her wounds and swoons. She licks the blood from her fingers, winks, and blows pink mist from her mouth. The sweet-smelling cloud rapidly fills the room, making your pulse quicken in the most pleasant way."
  "Combat.Ability.ValaSpecial1.Medium": "Vala dabs at one of her wounds and swoons, then blows a rose-colored vapor throughout the room. It smells sweet and makes your head swim with sensual promises."
  "Combat.Ability.ValaSpecial1.Name": "Blood Mist"
  "Combat.Ability.ValaSpecial2.Description": "Vala squeezes her chest, spraying milk and glittering faerie dust."
  "Combat.Ability.ValaSpecial2.Name": "Faerie Milk"
  "Combat.Ability.ValaSpecial2.Text": "With a look of ecstasy, Vala squeezes her pillowy chest and fires gouts of thick faerie milk at you, then flutters her wings and blows glittering dust that sticks to your milk-soaked skin. [say: Now you can be sexy like Vala!]"
  "Combat.Ability.WormMassWormAttack.Description": "Strikes with a limb made of worms."
