  "Combat.Ability.ZetazAttack.Description": "Zetaz rakes at you with his claws."
  "Combat.Ability.ZetazAttack.Name": "Claw"
  "Combat.Ability.ZetazDrain.Description": "Zetaz converts his own lust into healing."
  "Combat.Ability.ZetazDrain.Name": "Lust to Flesh"
  "Combat.Ability.ZetazDrain.Text": "The imp lord shudders and strokes his swollen member, murmuring under his breath. Bruises and wounds close before your eyes as he converts lust into health!"
  "Combat.Ability.ZetazGigaArouse.Description": "Zetaz makes exaggerated arcane gestures at you."
  "Combat.Ability.ZetazGigaArouse.Name": "Giga Arouse"
  "Combat.Ability.ZetazGigaArouse.Text": "You see Zetaz make familiar arcane gestures at you, but his motions seem a lot more over the top than you'd expect from an imp. A tidal wave of arousal washes over you!"
  "Combat.Ability.ZetazGust.Description": "Zetaz beats his wings and fills the room with blinding dust."
  "Combat.Ability.ZetazGust.Name": "Dust Tornado"
  "Combat.Ability.ZetazGust.Text": "The imp leaps into the air with a powerful spring, beating his wings hard. Dust kicks up into the air and turns the room into a blinding tornado!"
  "Combat.Ability.ZetazPotion.Coated": "The fragile glass shatters against you, coating you in sticky red liquid. It seeps into your skin and leaves a pleasant, residual tingle in its wake. Oh no..."
  "Combat.Ability.ZetazPotion.Description": "Zetaz hurls a bottle of red liquid."
  "Combat.Ability.ZetazPotion.Dodged": "You sidestep it a moment before it shatters on the wall, soaking the tapestries with red fluid!"
  "Combat.Ability.ZetazPotion.Name": "Thrown Potion"
  "Combat.Ability.ZetazPotion.Throw": "Zetaz grabs a bottle from a drawer and hurls it in your direction!"
