  "Combat.Ability.ClawStance.Name": "Claw Stance"
  "Combat.Ability.ClawStance.Description": "Prepare to maul and shred your prey."
  "Combat.Ability.ClawStance.Text": "You lurch forward and drop your center of gravity low, feeling your [skindesc] crawl with anticipation as you flex your digits."
